@startuml
!include skin.iuml
class Internship {
  + company : String
  + supervisorName : String
  + school : String
  + startDate : Date
  + endDate : Date
  + tags : String [0..*]
  --
  + weekSummary(weekStart : Date) : WeekSummary
  + buildReportOutline() : String
}
class LogEntry {
  + date : Date
  + text : String
  + minutes : Integer {1..1440}
  + tags : String [0..*]
  + difficulty : String [0..1]
  + solution : String [0..1]
  + learned : String [0..1]
  + position : String [0..1]
}
class ReportTemplate {
  + name : String
  + school : String
  + body : String
  + isDefault : Boolean
}
class WeekSummary <<computed>> {
  + weekStart : Date
  + totalMinutes : Integer
  + minutesByTag : Map<String, Integer>
  + daysLoggedInARow : Integer
  --
  + toMarkdown() : String
}
Internship "1" *-- "0..*" LogEntry : has >
Internship "0..*" --> "1" ReportTemplate : uses >
Internship ..> WeekSummary : computes >
note right of WeekSummary : Computed by the API from the entries;\nnever stored. «computed»
note bottom of LogEntry : One day totals 24 h at most (NF-08).\nposition: for the ENSPD report "par poste" (D-15).
note top of ReportTemplate : v1 ships ENSPD's template:\nMarkdown with placeholders (CR-07).
note left of Internship : tags: seeded with the ten defaults,\nrenamable per internship (D-15).
@enduml
